  "segments": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "start": 2.64,
      "end": 5.22,
      "en": "Hello English learners, welcome back to EnglishPod.",
      "zh": "您好英语学习者，欢迎回到 EnglishPod。"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "start": 5.38,
      "end": 5.82,
      "en": "My name is Marco.",
      "zh": "我叫 Marco。"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "start": 6.26,
      "end": 7.14,
      "en": "And I'm Erica.",
      "zh": "我叫 Erica。"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "start": 7.84,
      "end": 13.72,
      "en": "And today we're bringing you a lesson that was requested by one of our listeners.",
      "zh": "今天，我们为您带来了我们的一位听众要求的课程。"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "start": 14.18,
      "end": 14.76,
      "en": "Yes, that's right.",
      "zh": "对，没错。"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "start": 15.18,
      "end": 19.52,
      "en": "We got a request for a dialogue about a receptionist.",
      "zh": "我们收到了关于接待员的对话请求。"
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "start": 19.84,
      "end": 24.3,
      "en": "So a receptionist at an office or at a hotel.",
      "zh": "所以在办公室或酒店的接待员。"
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "start": 25.44,
      "end": 31.68,
      "en": "So today's dialogue is simple but we're going to be looking at some really great phrases.",
      "zh": "所以今天的对话很简单，但我们将看到一些非常棒的短语。"
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "start": 31.96,
      "end": 38.1,
      "en": "Yeah, phrases that will help you sound really, really professional and really fluent.",
      "zh": "是的，可以帮助你听起来非常、非常专业和流利的短语。"
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "start": 38.56,
      "end": 44.58,
      "en": "So we are at an office today and the receptionist is greeting somebody that has an appointment.",
      "zh": "所以我们今天在办公室，接待员正在迎接一位有预约的客人。"
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "start": 44.88,
      "end": 58.26,
      "en": "All right, let's see what happens.",
      "zh": "好吧，让我们看看会发生什么。"
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "start": 58.26,
      "end": 58.52,
      "en": "Good afternoon.",
      "zh": "下午好。"
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "start": 59.44,
      "end": 60.04,
      "en": "May I help you?",
      "zh": "有什么可以帮您？"
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "start": 60.5,
      "end": 63.06,
      "en": "Yes, I'm here to see Joanna Stevens.",
      "zh": "是的，我来见乔安娜·史蒂文斯。"
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "start": 63.46,
      "end": 65.54,
      "en": "I have an appointment at four.",
      "zh": "我约了四点见她。"
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "start": 65.54,
      "end": 66.54,
      "en": "Certainly.",
      "zh": "当然可以。"
    },
    {
      "id": 17,
      "start": 66.54,
      "end": 67.09,
      "en": "May I take your name?",
      "zh": "请问您贵姓？"
    },
    {
      "id": 18,
      "start": 67.63,
      "end": 68.77,
      "en": "I'll let her know you've arrived.",
      "zh": "我会通知她您到了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 19,
      "start": 69.17,
      "end": 69.47,
      "en": "Sure.",
      "zh": "当然。"
    },
    {
      "id": 20,
      "start": 70.26,
      "end": 74.26,
      "en": "It's Josh O'Neill.",
      "zh": "是乔什·奥尼尔。"
    },
    {
      "id": 21,
      "start": 74.26,
      "end": 75.42,
      "en": "Miss Stevens will be with you momentarily.",
      "zh": "史蒂文斯小姐马上就来。"
    },
    {
      "id": 22,
      "start": 76.46,
      "end": 77.66,
      "en": "Can I offer you something to drink?",
      "zh": "我可以给你喝点东西吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": 23,
      "start": 78.38,
      "end": 79.9,
      "en": "Yes, coffee would be nice.",
      "zh": "来杯咖啡就好，谢谢。"
    },
    {
      "id": 24,
      "start": 80.14,
      "end": 80.28,
      "en": "Thank you.",
      "zh": "谢谢。"
    },
    {
      "id": 25,
      "start": 89.16,
      "end": 89.94,
      "en": "Here you are.",
      "zh": "给你。"
    },
    {
      "id": 26,
      "start": 90.74,
      "end": 92.14,
      "en": "Miss Stevens is ready for you now.",
      "zh": "史蒂文斯小姐现在可以见您了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 27,
      "start": 92.8,
      "end": 94.98,
      "en": "I'll show you to her office right this way.",
      "zh": "这边请，我带您去她办公室。"
    },
    {
      "id": 28,
      "start": 98.66,
      "end": 100.04,
      "en": "Just watch your step here.",
      "zh": "这边小心脚下。"
    },
    {
      "id": 29,
      "start": 112.78,
      "end": 114.64,
      "en": "Well that's pretty embarrassing, hey?",
      "zh": "嗯，这很尴尬，嘿？"
    },
    {
      "id": 30,
      "start": 114.88,
      "end": 115.9,
      "en": "That was embarrassing.",
      "zh": "这很尴尬。"
    },
    {
      "id": 31,
      "start": 116.52,
      "end": 119.82,
      "en": "That's what happens to women when they wear high heels, see?",
      "zh": "这就是女性穿高跟鞋时会发生什么，看到了吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": 32,
      "start": 120.2,
      "end": 121.9,
      "en": "Actually that happened to me last weekend.",
      "zh": "实际上，上周末发生在我身上。"
    },
    {
      "id": 33,
      "start": 122.18,
      "end": 122.48,
      "en": "Really?",
      "zh": "真的吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": 34,
      "start": 122.82,
      "end": 124.88,
      "en": "I fell down the stairs and my knees are quite blue.",
      "zh": "我从楼梯上摔了下来，膝盖都摔青了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 35,
      "start": 126.2,
      "end": 126.8,
      "en": "Oh no, see?",
      "zh": "哦不，看到了吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": 36,
      "start": 127.56,
      "end": 128.74,
      "en": "High heels are dangerous.",
      "zh": "高跟鞋很危险。"
    },
    {
      "id": 37,
      "start": 129.14,
      "end": 130.78,
      "en": "I don't know why women wear them.",
      "zh": "不知道女人为什么要穿。"
    },
    {
      "id": 38,
      "start": 130.78,
      "end": 134.14,
      "en": "Well, I don't know, but that's not what we're here to discover.",
      "zh": "嗯，我不知道，不过这不是我们今天要探讨的话题。"
    },
    {
      "id": 39,
      "start": 134.62,
      "end": 134.74,
      "en": "Right.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 40,
      "start": 135.62,
      "end": 141.24,
      "en": "Okay, so let's take a look at some of these great phrases in Fluency Builder.",
      "zh": "好的，让我们来看看流利表达中的一些很棒的短语。"
    },
    {
      "id": 41,
      "start": 146.76,
      "end": 153.1,
      "en": "I really liked how this receptionist used some excellent phrases to sound really professional.",
      "zh": "我真的很喜欢这位接待员如何使用一些出色的短语来听起来非常专业。"
    },
    {
      "id": 42,
      "start": 154.54,
      "end": 156.9,
      "en": "One thing she said was, certainly.",
      "zh": "她说的一个词是 certainly。"
    },
    {
      "id": 43,
      "start": 158.31,
      "end": 158.89,
      "en": "Certainly.",
      "zh": "当然可以。"
    },
    {
      "id": 44,
      "start": 159.34,
      "end": 159.57,
      "en": "Certainly.",
      "zh": "当然可以。"
    },
    {
      "id": 45,
      "start": 160.62,
      "end": 161.91,
      "en": "So why did she say certainly?",
      "zh": "那她为什么说 certainly 呢？"
    },
    {
      "id": 46,
      "start": 162.66,
      "end": 170.63,
      "en": "Well this is a nice way to respond, to make the other person know that you understand what they said.",
      "zh": "好吧，这是一种很好的回应方式，让对方知道你明白他们所说的话。"
    },
    {
      "id": 47,
      "start": 171.16,
      "end": 175.49,
      "en": "So Josh O'Neil said, yes, I'm here to see you Joanna Stevens.",
      "zh": "所以乔什·奥尼尔说：是的，我是来见乔安娜·史蒂文斯的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 48,
      "start": 176.23,
      "end": 177.43,
      "en": "I have an appointment at four.",
      "zh": "我约了四点见她。"
    },
    {
      "id": 49,
      "start": 177.87,
      "end": 178.25,
      "en": "Certainly.",
      "zh": "当然可以。"
    },
    {
      "id": 50,
      "start": 178.79,
      "end": 180.99,
      "en": "So she is saying, I understand what you said.",
      "zh": "所以她说，我明白你说的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 51,
      "start": 181.51,
      "end": 181.63,
      "en": "Yes.",
      "zh": "是的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 52,
      "start": 182.5,
      "end": 184.58,
      "en": "So she said, may I take your name?",
      "zh": "所以她说，请问您贵姓？"
    },
    {
      "id": 53,
      "start": 184.58,
      "end": 185.55,
      "en": "May I take your name?",
      "zh": "请问您贵姓？"
    },
    {
      "id": 54,
      "start": 186.14,
      "end": 187.67,
      "en": "May I take your name?",
      "zh": "请问您贵姓？"
    },
    {
      "id": 55,
      "start": 188.1,
      "end": 191.61,
      "en": "So this is a nice way of saying, what is your name?",
      "zh": "所以这是一个很好的说法，你叫什么名字？"
    },
    {
      "id": 56,
      "start": 192.22,
      "end": 193.22,
      "en": "Yeah.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 57,
      "start": 193.22,
      "end": 197.63,
      "en": "So, now this is really important because if you said, what is your name?",
      "zh": "所以，现在这真的很重要，因为如果你说，你叫什么名字？"
    },
    {
      "id": 58,
      "start": 198.02,
      "end": 198.31,
      "en": "Is that correct?",
      "zh": "那是对的吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": 59,
      "start": 198.75,
      "end": 201.45,
      "en": "It's correct, but it's not really very...",
      "zh": "是对的，但它不是真的很..."
    },
    {
      "id": 60,
      "start": 202.26,
      "end": 202.55,
      "en": "Exactly.",
      "zh": "正是这样。"
    },
    {
      "id": 61,
      "start": 203.26,
      "end": 205.57,
      "en": "Or I would say polite to a certain extent.",
      "zh": "或者可以说，多多少少还算礼貌吧。"
    },
    {
      "id": 62,
      "start": 206.1,
      "end": 207.1,
      "en": "Yes.",
      "zh": "是的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 63,
      "start": 207.1,
      "end": 208.1,
      "en": "Okay.",
      "zh": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 64,
      "start": 208.1,
      "end": 209.1,
      "en": "So may I take your name?",
      "zh": "那我可以取你的名字吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": 65,
      "start": 209.1,
      "end": 209.51,
      "en": "May I take your name?",
      "zh": "请问您贵姓？"
    },
    {
      "id": 66,
      "start": 210.1,
      "end": 215.38,
      "en": "So you use this phrase when you are going to write down the person's name.",
      "zh": "所以当你要写下这个人的名字时，你会使用这个短语。"
    },
    {
      "id": 67,
      "start": 215.38,
      "end": 216.38,
      "en": "Right.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 68,
      "start": 216.38,
      "end": 221.58,
      "en": "So if you meet somebody on the street or at a bar, you wouldn't say, may I take your name?",
      "zh": "所以如果你在街上或在酒吧遇到某人，你不会说，我可以取你的名字吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": 69,
      "start": 222.06,
      "end": 223.06,
      "en": "No.",
      "zh": "不。"
    },
    {
      "id": 70,
