      "en": "Right.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 71,
      "start": 224.06,
      "end": 225.62,
      "en": "Unless you're going to write it down.",
      "zh": "除非你要把它写下来。"
    },
    {
      "id": 72,
      "start": 225.62,
      "end": 229.94,
      "en": "So usually for an office setting where the receptionist has to write down the name.",
      "zh": "所以这通常用在办公室场合，接待员需要记下姓名。"
    },
    {
      "id": 73,
      "start": 230.34,
      "end": 231.34,
      "en": "Yes.",
      "zh": "是的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 74,
