      "en": "Alright, one more phrase.",
      "zh": "好吧，再来一句。"
    },
    {
      "id": 75,
      "start": 233.1,
      "end": 235.9,
      "en": "Ms. Stevens will be with you momentarily.",
      "zh": "史蒂文斯女士马上就来见您。"
