      "en": "Soon.",
      "zh": "很快。"
    },
    {
      "id": 85,
      "start": 252.18,
      "end": 259.28,
      "en": "Again, she could have said, Ms. Stevens will come out soon or Ms. Stevens will see you in a minute.",
