    },
    {
      "id": 112,
      "start": 334.06,
      "end": 335.52,
      "en": "Just watch your step here.",
      "zh": "这边小心脚下。"
    },
    {
      "id": 113,
      "start": 339.93,
      "end": 346.31,
      "en": "Okay, so it's pretty clear now, but there are still a couple of phrases that I would like to look at.",
      "zh": "好的，所以现在很清楚，但我仍然想看几个短语。"
    },
    {
      "id": 114,
      "start": 346.83,
      "end": 350.05,
      "en": "So why don't we look at the last two sentences?",
      "zh": "那我们来看看最后两句话吧。"
    },
    {
      "id": 115,
      "start": 350.54,
      "end": 351.54,
      "en": "Okay.",
      "zh": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 116,
      "start": 351.54,
      "end": 353.09,
      "en": "Ms. Stevens is ready for you now.",
      "zh": "史蒂文斯女士现在可以见您了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 117,
      "start": 353.82,
      "end": 355.45,
      "en": "Ms. Stevens is ready for you now.",
      "zh": "史蒂文斯女士现在可以见您了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 118,
      "start": 356.78,
      "end": 359.06,
      "en": "Ms. Stevens is ready for you.",
      "zh": "史蒂文斯女士可以见您了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 119,
      "start": 359.06,
      "end": 362.15,
      "en": "So when she says ready for you, what does that mean?",
      "zh": "那么当她说为你准备好时，那是什么意思？"
    },
    {
      "id": 120,
      "start": 363.38,
      "end": 364.79,
      "en": "Prepared to speak to you.",
      "zh": "准备和你说话。"
    },
    {
      "id": 121,
      "start": 365.5,
      "end": 366.5,
      "en": "Okay.",
      "zh": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 122,
      "start": 366.5,
      "end": 374.53,
      "en": "So instead of saying Ms. Stevens is ready or Ms. Stevens can see you now, you use this great little phrase, is ready for you.",
      "zh": "所以与其说“史蒂文斯女士准备好了”或“史蒂文斯女士现在可以见你”，不如用这个很棒的小短语：is ready for you。"
    },
    {
      "id": 123,
      "start": 375.34,
      "end": 375.51,
      "en": "Okay.",
      "zh": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 124,
      "start": 376.34,
      "end": 378.49,
      "en": "And then she said I'll show you to her office.",
      "zh": "然后她说我会带你去她的办公室。"
    },
    {
      "id": 125,
      "start": 379.02,
      "end": 380.39,
      "en": "I'll show you to her office.",
      "zh": "我会带你去她的办公室。"
    },
    {
      "id": 126,
      "start": 381.03,
      "end": 382.49,
      "en": "I'll show you to her office.",
      "zh": "我会带你去她的办公室。"
    },
    {
      "id": 127,
      "start": 382.9,
      "end": 387.18,
      "en": "This is a lovely way of saying I will take you to the office.",
      "zh": "这是一个很好的说法，我会带你去办公室。"
    },
    {
      "id": 128,
      "start": 387.18,
      "end": 389.34,
      "en": "I will take you to the office.",
      "zh": "我会带你去办公室。"
    },
    {
      "id": 129,
      "start": 389.34,
      "end": 393.26,
      "en": "And she followed it by saying right this way.",
      "zh": "接着她又说：right this way。"
    },
    {
      "id": 130,
      "start": 393.26,
      "end": 393.85,
      "en": "Right this way.",
      "zh": "请往这边走。"
    },
    {
      "id": 131,
      "start": 394.42,
      "end": 395.07,
      "en": "Right this way.",
      "zh": "请往这边走。"
    },
    {
      "id": 132,
      "start": 395.86,
      "end": 397.91,
      "en": "So again, walk this way.",
      "zh": "所以，walk this way 也是“请这边走”。"
    },
    {
      "id": 133,
      "start": 398.44,
      "end": 398.77,
      "en": "Walk this way.",
      "zh": "请这边走。"
    },
    {
      "id": 134,
      "start": 399.44,
      "end": 400.44,
      "en": "This way, please.",
      "zh": "请这边走。"
    },
    {
      "id": 135,
      "start": 400.44,
      "end": 401.44,
      "en": "Yes.",
      "zh": "是的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 136,
      "start": 401.44,
      "end": 402.44,
      "en": "Right this way.",
      "zh": "请往这边走。"
    },
    {
      "id": 137,
      "start": 402.44,
      "end": 405.34,
      "en": "It sounds really, really nice, really polite, really welcoming.",
      "zh": "听起来真的，真的很好，很有礼貌，真的很热情。"
    },
    {
      "id": 138,
      "start": 405.9,
      "end": 406.9,
      "en": "Right.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 139,
      "start": 406.9,
      "end": 408.2,
      "en": "And especially if you use it together, right?",
      "zh": "特别是如果你们一起使用它，对吧？"
    },
    {
      "id": 140,
      "start": 408.36,
      "end": 411.02,
      "en": "I'll show you to her office right this way, please.",
      "zh": "我这就带您去她的办公室，请跟我这边走。"
    },
    {
      "id": 141,
      "start": 411.38,
      "end": 411.52,
      "en": "Yes.",
      "zh": "是的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 142,
      "start": 412.24,
      "end": 412.52,
      "en": "Okay.",
      "zh": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 143,
      "start": 412.68,
      "end": 417.32,
      "en": "So it's a really great way of being polite to somebody at an office.",
      "zh": "所以这是对办公室里的人有礼貌的一种非常好的方式。"
    },
    {
      "id": 144,
      "start": 417.98,
      "end": 422.44,
      "en": "Now the final useful phrase, watch your step.",
      "zh": "现在最后一个实用短语：小心脚下。"
    },
    {
      "id": 145,
      "start": 423.32,
      "end": 424.54,
      "en": "Watch your step.",
      "zh": "小心脚下。"
    },
    {
      "id": 146,
      "start": 424.54,
      "end": 426.66,
      "en": "Watch your step.",
      "zh": "小心脚下。"
    },
    {
      "id": 147,
      "start": 426.66,
      "end": 428.7,
      "en": "So watch your step.",
      "zh": "所以就是 watch your step，小心脚下。"
    },
    {
      "id": 148,
      "start": 428.7,
      "end": 430.3,
      "en": "You see that everywhere in science.",
      "zh": "你在科学中到处都能看到这一点。"
    },
    {
      "id": 149,
      "start": 431.06,
      "end": 431.38,
      "en": "Be careful.",
      "zh": "小心。"
    },
    {
      "id": 150,
      "start": 432.06,
      "end": 433.26,
      "en": "Be careful where you step.",
      "zh": "小心你走到哪里。"
    },
    {
      "id": 151,
      "start": 433.26,
      "end": 433.38,
      "en": "Yes.",
      "zh": "是的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 152,
      "start": 433.54,
      "end": 434.84,
      "en": "Be careful where you're walking.",
      "zh": "小心你走路的地方。"
    },
    {
      "id": 153,
      "start": 435.3,
      "end": 435.64,
      "en": "Okay.",
      "zh": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 154,
      "start": 435.96,
      "end": 439.88,
      "en": "So obviously she didn't watch her step and she fell.",
      "zh": "很明显，她没注意脚下，所以摔倒了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 155,
      "start": 440.12,
      "end": 440.56,
      "en": "She fell.",
      "zh": "她摔倒了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 156,
      "start": 441.38,
      "end": 441.66,
      "en": "Okay.",
      "zh": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 157,
      "start": 441.68,
      "end": 443.14,
      "en": "So really great phrases.",
      "zh": "所以真的很棒的短语。"
    },
    {
      "id": 158,
      "start": 443.78,
      "end": 445.8,
      "en": "Let's listen to this dialogue one last time.",
      "zh": "我们最后再听一遍这段对话。"
    },
    {
      "id": 159,
      "start": 454.63,
      "end": 455.41,
      "en": "Good afternoon.",
      "zh": "下午好。"
    },
    {
      "id": 160,
      "start": 456.05,
      "end": 456.85,
      "en": "May I help you?",
      "zh": "有什么可以帮您？"
    },
    {
      "id": 161,
      "start": 457.49,
      "end": 457.83,
      "en": "Yes.",
      "zh": "是的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 162,
      "start": 457.91,
      "end": 459.85,
      "en": "I'm here to see Joanna Stevens.",
      "zh": "我是来见乔安娜史蒂文斯的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 163,
      "start": 460.26,
      "end": 462.38,
      "en": "I have an appointment at four.",
      "zh": "我约了四点见她。"
    },
    {
      "id": 164,
      "start": 462.38,
      "end": 463.38,
      "en": "Certainly.",
      "zh": "当然可以。"
    },
    {
      "id": 165,
      "start": 463.38,
      "end": 463.89,
      "en": "May I take your name?",
      "zh": "请问您贵姓？"
    },
    {
      "id": 166,
      "start": 464.43,
      "end": 465.57,
      "en": "I'll let her know you've arrived.",
      "zh": "我会通知她您到了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 167,
      "start": 465.95,
      "end": 466.25,
      "en": "Sure.",
      "zh": "当然。"
    },
    {
      "id": 168,
      "start": 467.02,
      "end": 471.06,
      "en": "It's Josh O'Neill.",
      "zh": "是乔什·奥尼尔。"
    },
    {
      "id": 169,
      "start": 471.06,
      "end": 472.2,
      "en": "Miss Stevens will be with you momentarily.",
      "zh": "史蒂文斯小姐马上就来。"
    },
    {
      "id": 170,
      "start": 473.26,
      "end": 474.46,
      "en": "Can I offer you something to drink?",
      "zh": "我可以给你喝点东西吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": 171,
      "start": 475.04,
      "end": 475.34,
      "en": "Yes.",
      "zh": "是的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 172,
      "start": 476.14,
      "end": 476.7,
      "en": "Coffee would be nice.",
      "zh": "来杯咖啡就好。"
    },
    {
      "id": 173,
      "start": 477.14,
      "end": 486.42,
      "en": "Thank you.",
      "zh": "谢谢。"
    },
    {
      "id": 174,
      "start": 486.42,
      "end": 486.74,
      "en": "Here you are.",
      "zh": "给你。"
    },
    {
      "id": 175,
      "start": 487.66,
      "end": 488.94,
      "en": "Miss Stevens is ready for you now.",
      "zh": "史蒂文斯小姐现在可以见您了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 176,
      "start": 489.62,
      "end": 491.78,
      "en": "I'll show you to her office right this way.",
      "zh": "这边请，我带您去她办公室。"
    },
    {
      "id": 177,
      "start": 495.52,
      "end": 496.84,
      "en": "Just watch your step here.",
      "zh": "这边小心脚下。"
    },
    {
      "id": 178,
      "start": 505.33,
      "end": 513.79,
      "en": "Alright so a really simple dialogue but with a lot of good phrases in there and it's also a good review for more advanced students, right?",
      "zh": "好吧，一个非常简单的对话，但里面有很多好短语，对水平较高的学生来说也是一次很好的复习，对吧？"
    },
    {
      "id": 179,
      "start": 513.99,
      "end": 514.13,
      "en": "Yeah.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 180,
      "start": 515.18,
      "end": 521.98,
      "en": "Remember like these phrases can really help you sound more professional, more welcoming, more polite basically.",
      "zh": "记住这些短语真的可以帮助你听起来更专业、更热情、更有礼貌。"
    },
    {
      "id": 181,
      "start": 521.98,
      "end": 522.98,
      "en": "Okay.",
      "zh": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 182,
      "start": 522.98,
      "end": 528.02,
      "en": "So if you have any questions or doubts, please come to our website EnglishPod.com.",
      "zh": "所以如果你有任何问题或疑问，请访问我们的网站 EnglishPod.com。"
    },
    {
      "id": 183,
      "start": 528.02,
      "end": 532.39,
      "en": "And Marco and I are always around to respond to your questions and comments.",
      "zh": "Marco 和我总是在身边回答您的问题和评论。"
    },
    {
      "id": 184,
      "start": 532.86,
      "end": 533.37,
      "en": "Okay guys.",
      "zh": "好吧伙计们。"
    },
    {
      "id": 185,
      "start": 533.86,
      "end": 536.49,
      "en": "So we'll see you there and until next time it's goodbye.",
      "zh": "所以我们会在那里见到你，直到下次再见。"
    }
